  "notes": "\"H\" stamped in runouts denotes a [l465444] pressing.\nDynaflex. RCA Victor orange label. Sleeve printed by Shorepak-U.S.\nComes with a white inner sleeve that has some RCA-Dynaflex blurb (see picture).\n\nFront and back covers have a gold ink finish at top of edges\n\nCopies used for radio promotion have a large white sticker on the front sleeve marked \"PLEASE AUDITION BEFORE RADIO AIRPLAY\" with track-list and timings. (See Images.)",
